      "statement": "The 2025-06 historical overweight was a 12-to-18-month US semiconductor-capital-equipment view, expressed through capital equipment rather than fabless or memory, based on an early wafer-fab-equipment cycle after a Q4 2024 trough and two quarters of growth.",
