    {
      "id": "claim_913fd50679a64b58a50ddf9ffc60ddbc",
      "statement": "The 2025-06 view treated extended lithography and deposition lead times and reduced top-three-customer concentration as confirming quality evidence, attributing the latter to two new leading-edge logic-foundry customers.",
