      "statement": "The current 2026-02 neutral recommendation is driven by valuation and a late-cycle position, not a deterioration in fundamentals: spending had risen for six quarters, lead times had ceased extending and shortened modestly in deposition, and the desk read that as an ordinary late-cycle rather than demand signal.",
